      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قيّأهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> (a man, S, Mgh, O, Msb,) or <i>it,</i>
(medicine, K,) <i>caused him to vomit;</i> (S, * Mgh,
O, * Msb, K; *) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقآءهُ</span></b>  signifies the same.
